  "notes": "Composed of {検|けん} (examine) + {眼|がん} (eye).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {検眼|けんがん}を{受|う}ける: to have an eye examination\n- {検眼|けんがん}{士|し}: optometrist (technician)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {視力検査|しりょくけんさ}: vision test — measures acuity specifically, one part of {検眼|けんがん}\n- {眼科|がんか}: ophthalmology — the medical department that treats the eyes",
